MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Menglin,

If fit is your blavaan object, try

pt <- parTable(fit)

standardizedSolution(fit, se=pt$se[pt$free > 0])

Ed

