Russell,

A marginal log-likelihood of -Inf is a bug. If you can send me the model code and data if possible, that would help me track it down. In the meantime, you could do model comparisons with the WAIC and LOO metrics (I would say that those are more reliable anyway, at least as implemented in blavaan).

Happy holidays,
Ed

